<title>USA: HORSE RACING-SILVER CHARM WINS 123RD KENTUCKY DERBY.</title>
<headline>HORSE RACING-SILVER CHARM WINS 123RD KENTUCKY DERBY.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Kentucky 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Silver Charm, ridden by Gary Stevens, won the 123rd running of the Kentucky Derby thoroughbred horse race on Saturday.</p>
<p>Captain Bodgit finished second and Free House came in third.</p>
</text>
